Package: iperf3-uefi
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: iperf3 client for the UEFI Shell
 iperf3-uefi is an iperf3 client built on EDK II network protocols. It
 supports TCP and UDP tests over IPv4 or IPv6, DNS server names, reverse mode,
 and configurable transfer limits, bitrate, block size, and report intervals.